{
  "content_id": "l2-trigger-dictionaries-v1.0.0",
  "dictionary_version": "l2-domain-pack-v1.0.0",
  "taxonomy_version": "l2-task-type-taxonomy-v1.0.0",
  "normalization": {
    "nfc": true,
    "casefold": true,
    "strip": true,
    "unicode_whitespace_collapse": true,
    "punctuation_stripping": false,
    "en_matching": "word-boundary phrase matching",
    "zh_CN_matching": "substring phrase matching (multi-character phrases only, length >= 2)"
  },
  "matching_notes": [
    "Normalization discipline follows L2_TASK_TYPE_TAXONOMY_CONTRACT.md Constraint 1.2 (casefold, whitespace/punctuation normalization, word-boundary matching; same discipline as the frozen corpus features).",
    "Word-boundary matching uses ASCII word boundaries; phrase-internal whitespace matches any whitespace run.",
    "zh_CN phrases are matched as substrings of the normalized prompt; single-character phrases are excluded from the content by validation.",
    "Both locale dictionaries are matched against the same normalized prompt (locale-agnostic matching); a prompt may mix scripts.",
    "Type-name genre labels (e.g. 'opinion essay', 'argumentative essay') are NOT request triggers: G5 content decision recorded in docs/domain/L2_DOMAIN_PACK_V1_CONTENT.md (V1 adjudication A-8 assigns machine detection to G5 content)."
  ],
